## What was modified

This fork injects **SYuki's** differentiated features into the LingChat architecture.
Key changes (relative to upstream LingChat):

- 🧠 **Layered memory system (L1-L4)** — per-role isolated memory bank, auto-compressing
  short-term / long-term / user profile / promises (AI doesn't mix up memories across roles).
- 🎵 **NetEase Cloud Music** — search / mood-based recommendation / **app-level global
  background playback** (keeps playing across pages & during gameplay, independent volume),
  with AI "send-song → auto-play" bridging.
- 📺 **Bilibili learning** — provides Bilibili internet culture to the AI (hot list / search /
  danmaku memes / top-comments knowledge base), AI can autonomously search & call tools.
- 💗 **Proactive + heartbeat system** — when the user leaves, the AI proactively chats
  ("missing you"), and can run multi-role autonomous dialogue via the god agent.
- 🌐 **AI tool system** — search / weather / music etc., configurable via the settings panel.
- 🎭 **Persona refinement** — refined the character `system_prompt` (dedup / less off-topic /
  more human-like) and a more natural dialogue example.
- ⚡ **Performance** — fixed the `CursorEffects` idle `requestAnimationFrame` spin-loop.

See [docs/L-SYuki-changes.md](docs/L-SYuki-changes.md) for the detailed change log.

